# ...but the role provisioning SQL is infrastructure, not an export, and
# compose.yaml mounts it. A missing source becomes a directory and the init no-ops.
!docs/db/
!docs/db/*.sql

# The medex scrape the one-time catalogue import reads — `specs/01-catalog/SPEC.md` §5 Q1.
# `medicines.csv` is 136 MB, above GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit, so committing it would
# make the repository unpushable. The seeder takes `--dir`, so the files are supplied out of
# band: kept here for a dev run, copied to the host for a production one.
Extra Docs/
